Package: ecsr10
Type: Package
Title: Elixhauser Comorbidity Software for ICD-10-CM
Version: 0.5.0
Author: Dong Pei
Maintainer: Dong Pei <peidong2009@gmail.com>
Authors@R: person("Dong", "Pei", email = "peidong2009@gmail.com", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R implementation of AHRQ/HCUP's Elixhauser Comorbidity Software
    for ICD-10-CM Diagnoses, covering both families the agency has published.
    The Refined software (v2021.1 through v2026.1) assigns 38 comorbidity
    measures, 18 of them using Present on Admission indicators, and the two
    comorbidity indices from v2022.1 on. The superseded beta software (v2016.2
    through v2020.1) assigns 30 measures and screens on MS-DRG instead of POA.
    Either family is selectable per call, together covering ICD-10-CM diagnosis
    codes from October 2015 through September 2026. Defaults to Refined
    v2026.1.
